id: pm-8wskoj
title: "CodeQL alert 33: eliminate polynomial trailing-whitespace matching in SDK append"
description: "Merged-head CodeQL reports high-severity js/polynomial-redos at src/sdk/lifecycle/append.ts:92 because the append primitive applies a repetition-sensitive trailing-whitespace regular expression to item body input. Replace it with a linear built-in operation and add an adversarial regression that preserves append spacing semantics."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[5]: append,"area:sdk",codeql,redos,security
created_at: "2026-08-01T08:25:57.892Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-01T08:33:15.913Z"
