completed_at: "2026-08-01T08:33:15.203Z"
author: "harness:codex"
parent: pm-usfg
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "SDK append removes arbitrary trailing whitespace in linear time while preserving blank-body, spacer, mutation, and provenance semantics."
actual_result: "The repetition-sensitive /\\s+$/ expression operated on unbounded stored item bodies and CodeQL classified the merged-head path as high-severity polynomial ReDoS."
